# Reference clang-format configuration of nipscernlab, GUIDELINES.md section 6.
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
IndentWidth: 4
ContinuationIndentWidth: 4
UseTab: Never
ColumnLimit: 100
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: Empty
AllowShortIfStatementsOnASingleLine: Never
AllowShortLoopsOnASingleLine: false
InsertBraces: true
SortIncludes: Never
